{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00190","headline":"麟德殿宴百僚 · 德宗皇帝","name":"麟德殿宴百僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忧勤承圣绪，开泰喜时康。\n恭己临羣后，垂衣御八荒。\n务闲春向暮，朝罢日犹长。\n紫殿初筵列，彤庭广乐张。\n成功归辅弼，致理赖忠良。\n共此欢娱事，千秋乐未央。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}